o/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894790/extras/718f9810f7a5ed8768892ae2bcabcec2.webp?t=1765531500\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>Purchase and Upgrade Lab Equipment</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894790/extras/718f9810f7a5ed8768892ae2bcabcec2.webp?t=1765531500\" width=32 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve research efficiency by acquiring and upgrading equipment. Don\u2019t forget to add some entertainment facilities to relieve stress and prevent burnout. Transform your humble lab into a cutting-edge, intelligent research hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894790/extras/a57f43e2c6c36f9873c510e54122a72d.poster.avif?t=1765531500\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894790/extras/a57f43e2c6c36f9873c510e54122a72d.webm?t=1765531500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894790/extras/a57f43e2c6c36f9873c510e54122a72d.mp4?t=1765531500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894790/extras/0e3acf