espected full Professor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894790/extras/68ef209ad5a774ac4b0a3ce24a54825c.poster.avif?t=1765531500\" width=426 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894790/extras/68ef209ad5a774ac4b0a3ce24a54825c.webm?t=1765531500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hardships along the way? Only you will truly understand.</p>","developers":["HCL"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894790/5a9a8ea9dda70117298cb79fb46b537af100d262/header.jpg?t=1765531500","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.9+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX9<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3894790/222306839/23489dad2e590a5293fbf23b99b7f401ccd2c3e8/1760066195/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764610435","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3894790/222306839/23489dad2e590a5293fbf23b99b7f401ccd2c3e8/1760066195/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764610435","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3894790/222306839/23489dad2e590a5293fbf23b99b7f401ccd2c3e8/1760066195/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764610435","id":257176623,"name":"Gameplay Showcase","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176623/1444587f2e547bf02631ac35483c377d142d2583/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764610435"}],"name":"Profe